[$in title:Browser behaviour]
[$in description:Separate static components from runtime DOM operations and future typed events.]
[$in head:[language_theme_head]]

[navbar]
[sidebar]
init_docs_sidebar()!

[section, $md:
    # Browser behaviour

    Static HTML remains a value. Runtime functions may use browser capabilities
    to work with the live document. Later, typed event messages and Channels
    will connect browser inputs to Moth application logic.

    This pattern describes the final architectural direction. Its Basic and
    Advanced examples are being developed in this section.
]

